// The four rc6 session frames' constants the god rays and the night curve are judged on (2026-11-06 captures, read from each capture's cbdump.csv /
// cb.csv; a few hundred bytes of rows each, no texture and no dump). Order everywhere: capture 1 .. 4. The cascades are the four
// g_DirectionalShadowParameter instances of the frame (128 bytes: the light-space matrix, the distance row, the ramp row, the fade row, the map row),
// finest first; the inverse projection is g_CameraParameter +0x0E0; the light is the main view's directional draw (view space, toward the light) and
// its diffuse colour; the fog sun is cFogParam[2].xyz (world space); the view rows are g_CameraParameter +0x000 (three rows of four).
